c. Confirmation that the factory has approval from theFactories Inspectorate and Pollution Control Board;d. An explanation in simple terms of the hazardousprocess(es) carried on in the premises;e. The common names of the hazardous substancesused which could give rise to an accident likely toaffect them, with an indication of their principalharmful characteristics;
