ii. if he is a member of two such bodies, be the body whichthe appellant desired should appoint such assessor; andiii. if the appellant is not a member of any of the aforesaidbodies or if he does not state in the memorandum which ofsuch bodies he desires should appoint the assessot be thebody which the appellant authority considers as the bestfitted to represent the industry concerned.
