a. When operating valves or cocks controlling fluids etc. ;b. Drawing off a molten sulphur from sulphur pots ;c. Handling charcoal or sulphur.Suitable respiratory protective equipment shall be provided and stored in theappropriate place for use during abnormal conditions or in an emergency.Arrangements shall be made for proper and efficient cleaning of all suchprotective equipment.Cloakrooms.-There shall be provided and maintained for the use of allpersons employed in the processes a suitable cloakroom for clothing put offduring work hours and a suitable place separate from the cloakroom for thestorage or overalls or working clothes. The accommodation so provided shallbe placed in the charge of a responsible person and shall be kept clean.Unauthorized persons.-Only maintenance and repair personnel, personsdirectly connected with the plant operation and those accompanied byauthorized persons shall be admitted into the plant.
